      "title": "Try to disprove each guarantee",
      "body": "<p>For each option, look for nonzero x and y that satisfy its inequality but have <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02265;</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></math>. Try both negative and positive values.</p>",
